WEBVTT

00:10:59.271 --> 00:11:01.478
You never want to go back
to black and white.

00:11:01.478 --> 00:11:04.820
(Laughter)

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.956
DI: Danny was about five feet tall

00:11:06.956 --> 00:11:10.369
with crossed eyes
and one single snaggletooth,

00:11:10.369 --> 00:11:14.061
but Danny Perasa had
more romance in his little pinky

00:11:14.061 --> 00:11:17.174
than all of Hollywood's
leading men put together.

00:11:17.174 --> 00:11:19.077
What else have I learned?

00:11:19.077 --> 00:11:21.979
I've learned about the almost
unimaginable capacity

00:11:21.979 --> 00:11:24.162
for the human spirit to forgive.

00:11:24.162 --> 00:11:27.807
I've learned about resilience
and I've learned about strength.

00:11:27.807 --> 00:11:31.150
Like an interview with Oshea Israel
and Mary Johnson.